        question: "Marta rolls two six-sided dice to pick which two carts get checked, and she needs Cart Three flagged for at least one of them, since that's the cart Dill's missing loaf came in on. What is the probability that at least one of the two dice shows a 3?",
        options: ["1 in 6", "11 in 36", "1 in 3", "25 in 36"],
